---
import Layout from '~/layouts/DocumentLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Proof of Consent - Garber Squared LLC',
  description: 'Documentation of user consent for receiving SMS and messaging communications from Garber Squared LLC.',
};

const details = [
  {
    title: 'Consent Storage',
    description:
      'All consent records are securely stored with timestamps, including the date, time, method of consent, and user contact information.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Message Frequency',
    description:
      'Users are informed about expected message frequency. We typically send no more than 4 messages per month unless related to active service engagements.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Data Privacy',
    description:
      'User contact information is never shared with third parties for marketing purposes and is only used for direct communication related to our services.',
  },
  {
    title: 'TCPA Compliance',
    description:
      'Our consent practices comply with the Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA) and require explicit opt-in before sending marketing messages.',
  },
];
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <article class="sow-clause sow-clause--first">
    <p class="sow-num" aria-hidden="true">§</p>
    <div class="sow-clause__body sow-prose">
      <h1>Proof of Consent Documentation</h1>
      <p class="sow-note">Messaging Consent</p>

      <p>
        <strong>Consent Policy</strong> This page documents how Garber Squared LLC obtains explicit consent from users before
        sending SMS or messaging communications.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Obtain Consent</h2>
      <p>Garber Squared LLC is committed to respecting your communication preferences and privacy.</p>
      <p>
        Before sending any SMS messages or other forms of messaging communications, we obtain explicit, opt-in consent
        from our users through one or more of the following methods:
      </p>

      <h3>1. Contact Form Consent</h3>
      <p>
        When users submit our contact form at <a href="/contact">/contact</a>, they are presented with a clear
        disclaimer that states:
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        "By submitting this contact form, you acknowledge and agree to the collection of your personal information."
      </blockquote>
      <p>
        This consent includes permission to contact the user via their provided contact information, including SMS
        messaging if a phone number is provided.
      </p>

      <h3>2. Explicit Opt-In Checkbox</h3>
      <p>
        Where applicable, users must actively check a box indicating their consent to receive SMS messages and marketing
        communications. This checkbox is unchecked by default and includes clear language such as:
      </p>
      <blockquote>
        "I consent to receive SMS messages and communications from Garber Squared LLC. Message and data rates may apply.
        Reply STOP to opt out at any time."
      </blockquote>

      <h3>3. Appointment Booking Consent</h3>
      <p>
        When users book appointments through our Google Calendar integration, they provide their contact information and
        are informed that we may send appointment reminders and follow-up communications via SMS.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights and Opt-Out Options</h2>
      <p>
        We respect your right to control your communication preferences. You can opt out of receiving SMS messages at
        any time using any of these methods:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any SMS message you receive from us</li>
        <li>Reply <strong>UNSUBSCRIBE</strong> to any SMS message you receive from us</li>
        <li>Contact us directly at <a href="mailto:alex@garbersquared.com">alex@garbersquared.com</a></li>
        {
          /* Phone hidden until a business number is supplied.
        <li>Call us at <a href="tel:+18445242556">+1 (844) 524-2556</a></li>
        */
        }
      </ul>
      <p>
        Upon receiving an opt-out request, we will promptly remove your contact information from our messaging lists and
        cease all SMS communications within 24 hours.
      </p>

      <h2>Consent Documentation Details</h2>
      <p class="sow-note">Compliance Information</p>
      <ul class="sow-rows">
        {
          details.map(({ title, description }) => (
            <li class="sow-row">
              <span class="sow-row__num" aria-hidden="true" />
              <h3 class="sow-row__name">{title}</h3>
              <p class="sow-row__text">{description}</p>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about our consent practices or wish to review, modify, or revoke your consent, please
        contact us:
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Garber Squared LLC</strong><br />
        <strong>Email:</strong>
        <a href="mailto:alex@garbersquared.com">alex@garbersquared.com</a><br />
        {
          /* Phone hidden until a business number is supplied.
        <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+18445242556">+1 (844) 524-2556</a><br />
        */
        }
        <strong>Mailing Address:</strong> P.O. Box 321, Walkersville, MD 21793, USA
      </p>

      <p class="sow-note"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 7, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
